  "name": "One-Pot Vegan Potato Lentil Curry",
  "subtitle": "A hearty curry with tender potatoes and red lentils",
  "description": "This one-pot curry combines potatoes, red lentils, tomatoes, coconut milk, and aromatic spices for a warming vegan main dish.",
